        <p>The assessment structure follows the <a href="https://umd-huang-lab.github.io/cmsc848n-fall2025/syllabus.html">Fall 2025 syllabus</a>. Dates below are planned; the final Fall 2026 syllabus will confirm them, grade thresholds, and whether plus/minus grading is used.</p>
